<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/356bcf50034c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "GM Cruise Robotaxis Blocked SF Streets More Frequently Than We Knew, One Night ‘Nearly 60’ Cars Stopped" ;
