<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5216325a040d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Calvin Hu was driving with his girlfriend near San Francisco’s Golden Gate Park when he pulled up at an intersection behind two white and orange autonomous Chevrolet Bolts operated by Cruise, a subsidiary of General Motors." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1605" .

